0..80 Comment "//! The Lucas–Lehmer test shows that thirty-one, two to the fifth less one, is"
81..91 Comment "//! prime."
92..95 Comment "//!"
96..176 Comment "//! Boespflug, Dénès and Grégoire decide a Mersenne number\'s primality by the"
177..259 Comment "//! Lucas–Lehmer test. Its squares and remainders allocate large unary naturals."
260..263 Comment "//!"
264..340 Comment "//! From four, the test squares, subtracts two and takes the remainder three"
341..400 Comment "//! times. At one hundred and twenty-seven the run outlasts"
401..426 Comment "//! the conversion\'s step"
427..438 Comment "//! budget."
439..442 Comment "//!"
443..524 Comment "//! - cites: [Boespflug-2011-full_reduction_at_full_throttle], § 4, Lucas-Lehmer"
525..563 Comment "//! - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
564..567 Comment "//!"
568..734 Comment "//! [Boespflug-2011-full_reduction_at_full_throttle]: https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-25379-9_26 \"Boespflug, Dénès and Grégoire, Full Reduction at Full Throttle\""
